# Credentials for causal-presidents ingestion.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit a real key.
# All three sources are free; none require payment.

# FRED — Brent crude (DCOILBRENTEU), the oil covariate for the VECM/ARDL family.
# Register: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
FRED_API_KEY=

# UCDP GED — organised-violence fatalities for the security domain (CC-BY, redistributable).
# NOT NEEDED as of 2026-10-17: the API wants a token (401 without one) but the **bulk archive** that the
# landed series comes from is keyless — no credential at all. `ingestion/flows/pull_ucdp.py` reads
# https://ucdp.uu.se/downloads/ged/ged251-csv.zip directly. Kept (commented) only for the API route.
# UCDP_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# ACLED — security events. NOTE: ACLED now uses OAuth app registration, not an API key,
# and its raw data may NOT be redistributed. See docs/decisions.md C-13 before wiring it up.
# ACLED_CLIENT_ID=
# ACLED_CLIENT_SECRET=

# App-side (Stage 9, not needed yet)
# GROQ_API_KEY=
